{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_663C0BDD","title":"Caleb Foamheart joins the quest","entry":"Dlg_663C0BDD::entry","exit":"Dlg_663C0BDD::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_F07246B7","articyId":"72057645577641458","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Helm's alee, matey! What can I do for you today?","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Helm's alee, matey! What can I do for you today?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26376","byteOffset":17860064,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_6A308D78","articyId":"72057645577641479","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"No no no! No and no. There IS no going back.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No no no! No and no. There IS no going back.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27014","byteOffset":18099720,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_4453A932","articyId":"72057645577641501","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"He sent you! We are not on good terms. Not at all. Salt Pete is a scurrilous, kniving dirt dog. A rusty scrapheap of lies and slander. And he's not even a good sailor!","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He sent you! We are not on good terms. Not at all. Salt Pete is a scurrilous, kniving dirt dog. A rusty scrapheap of lies and slander. And he's not even a good sailor!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":1900.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23809","byteOffset":16888000,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_A80EF531","articyId":"72057645577641523","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Never! Not in a thousand millennia. A million.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Never! Not in a thousand millennia. A million.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2500.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42699","byteOffset":30481224,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_8981D117","articyId":"72057645577641529","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"She should never be brought back.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"She should never be brought back.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2500.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37470","byteOffset":28513952,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_D74DEEA9","articyId":"72057645577641545","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"So we just bring her back? And for what? To see the disappointment on her screen when she sees the three sailors who let her down? Who betrayed her. Who... broke the sailors code.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So we just bring her back? And for what? To see the disappointment on her screen when she sees the three sailors who let her down? Who betrayed her. Who... broke the sailors code.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41732","byteOffset":30116296,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_FE6C2EDA","articyId":"72057645577641566","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Look... I can help you matey. I see your invested in putting the Captain back together. But... I can't fix her. Not no more. Maybe Crabface can do it. Though he won't be happy to see you.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look... I can help you matey. I see your invested in putting the Captain back together. But... I can't fix her. Not no more. Maybe Crabface can do it. Though he won't be happy to see you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3700.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26134","byteOffset":17768392,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_C9B85F47","articyId":"72057645577641595","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"Please! Don't start that.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Please! Don't start that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":4925.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20549","byteOffset":15658392,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_2071001A","articyId":"72057821671326809","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"And when you find out what we did... remember we were all fools. But we believed in our mission. We... we really believed.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And when you find out what we did... remember we were all fools. But we believed in our mission. We... we really believed.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name"