b Foamheart","text":"No riddles for me. I got no time for that nonsense. You'll find the last piece of the Captain far out, at the edge of Nivalis waters. At the border of The Gridless Sea.","speakerId":"Ntt_5D312080","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No riddles for me. I got no time for that nonsense. You'll find the last piece of the Captain far out, at the edge of Nivalis waters. At the border of The Gridless Sea.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4325.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22836","byteOffset":16523160,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_70594C75","articyId":"72057645577641588","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What is The Gridless Sea?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What is The Gridless Sea?","TextSheVersion":"What is The Gridless Sea?","TextTheyVersion":"What is The Gridless Sea?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4625.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48256","byteOffset":32592512,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_5FE66829","articyId":"72057645577641602","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Don't start what?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Don't start what?","TextSheVersion":"Don't start what?","TextTheyVersion":"Don't start what?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5225.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51947","byteOffset":34067512,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_01640EFA","articyId":"72057645577641609","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Caleb Foamheart","text":"The Gridless Sea and its nature is... It matters not. Just go and find the last piece of the Captain. She's in the North - go as far a